		(at 192 116 63)
		(descr "KOGUMA MK4 wall sensor emitter (OPV332, T-1 3mm) in the sensor holder v3 (hole 7.6mm from the board, peg 0.4mm forward of the back face; peg hole 3.0 x 3.0 mm with square corners, no clearance, same as ToraNeko.Mk3 (2026-11-24)). The holder hangs under the board: place this footprint on the back side (flipped). Includes the holder peg hole (Edge.Cuts) and outline. Origin = centre of the holder front face, beam +X. Place WallSensor_Holder_Receiver at the same position and rotation")
